[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6188240009","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124493#issuecomment-6188240009","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124493","id":6188240009,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABcNkMiQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-15T08:50:38Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T08:50:38Z","body":"CC @deralmas @skorpnok ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6188240009/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6190208256","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124493#issuecomment-6190208256","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124493","id":6190208256,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABcPcVAA","user":{"login":"skorpnok","id":6632336,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MzIzMzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6632336?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok","html_url":"https://github.com/skorpnok","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skorpnok/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-15T10:43:41Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T13:35:19Z","body":"Looking into it it seems a wayland surface is getting destroyed in between the activation token being created and used. I'm working on it.\nedit: I think I found the bug. It's a concurrency use after free that was never a problem before. @deralmas I see two options:\nAdd a semaphore to window_state to signal if it can currently be destroyed and block if it can't, or, the one I'm tending towards, let it \"destroy\" it immediately, add a valid flag and let the last borrower remove it from the hashmap.\n\nedit2: I also have a simpler \"solution\" that just minimizes the time-window for the race condition. It did fix the crash in my case but the Windowstate is getting destroyed at literally the same time as the attention is being activated so it isn't exactly foolproof. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6190208256/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":